cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite this repository."
type: software
title: "Jev Account Filter"
authors:
  - name: "Jev Account Filter contributors"
    type: entity
repository-code: "https://github.com/caiweihan/jev-account-filter"
url: "https://github.com/caiweihan/jev-account-filter"
abstract: >-
  Account screening and channel classification for video-platform dataset
  curation and research. Decision models rank video titles and evaluate selected
  thumbnails with profile metadata. Sign language account discovery is a
  validated application; category rules and platform adapters are extensible.
keywords:
  - account screening
  - channel classification
  - creator discovery
  - sign language
  - dataset curation
  - decision models
license: MIT
